# Azure App Service custom-container SSH config.
# Azure's Kudu/SCM "Web SSH" console tunnels into the container and connects to
# this sshd on port 2222 — it is not exposed on the App Service's public ingress,
# only reachable through the authenticated SCM site, so PasswordAuthentication
# here is scoped to that private tunnel, not the public internet.
Port 2222
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0
LoginGraceTime 180
X11Forwarding no
StrictModes yes
SyslogFacility DAEMON
PasswordAuthentication yes
PermitEmptyPasswords no
PermitRootLogin yes
Subsystem sftp internal-sftp
